# Docker build context excludes.
#
# .env / .env.production are intentionally NOT excluded: `next build` reads
# them and inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* values at build time (e.g. the trial's
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_ACCOUNT_ENABLED). Excluding them would silently change
# what gets built. They only reach the builder stage, never the final image.
.git
node_modules
.next
out
build
dist
coverage
storage
tmp
var
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
